WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,330 --> 00:00:03,810
Lin Dong

2
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:06,130
Is there anything to eat at your house?

3
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:07,130
And there are many more

4
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:09,190
Great, Lin Dong

5
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:10,190
Can you give us some food?

6
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:12,190
Of course that's not possible

7
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:15,500
Drinking ice mineral music in winter

8
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,500
It's also very cool

9
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,500
Could it be that you ignore money?

10
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,500
Maybe it's because you can't reach a higher level in the future

11
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,500
Lin Dong must have a lot of supplies at home

12
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,500
Otherwise, who will be fine at this time?

13
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,710
Bring out Coke to pretend to be Lin Dong

14
00:00:27,710 --> 00:00:28,710
Do you think this will work?

15
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:30,710
we are willing to spend money to buy

16
00:00:30,710 --> 00:00:31,710
One hundred for a bottle of water

17
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:32,710
As long as it's edible

18
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:33,710
We all bought it at ten times the price

19
00:00:33,710 --> 00:00:34,900
OK or not

20
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:36,900
Do you think I'm a fool?

21
00:00:36,900 --> 00:00:37,900
What to do?

22
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:38,900
You are the only one who is willing to share some food with us
